Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:29:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command routing so provider
 commands bypass prompt sends

Selected agent messages that start with provider slash commands are handled by the backend command hook instead of the normal send path. The default AgentBackend implementation rejects unsupported commands, while Codex handles supported commands without wrapping them as follow-up prompt text.
